==Distribution==
''Selenicereus'' is the largest genus in the tribe, and is native from [[Texas]] though [[Central America]] and the [[Caribbean]] into [[South America]] as far as [[:Category:Flora of Northeast Argentina|Northeast Argentina]].<ref name=POWO_30011812-2/> Other genera have a more restricted distribution within this area; for example, the two species of ''Aporocactus'' are native to [[Mexico]].<ref name=POWO_5203-1/>

